<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy – SHINEX</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .privacy-container { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px; }
        .privacy-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 24px; border: 1px solid #ede8f5; }
        body.dark-mode .privacy-card { background: #111111; border-color: #333; }
        .privacy-card h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1A0A2E; margin: 0 0 2px; }
        body.dark-mode .privacy-card h1 { color: #ffffff; }
        .privacy-card .subtitle { color: #7a6a8f; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 16px; }
        body.dark-mode .privacy-card .subtitle { color: #b0a0c0; }
        .privacy-card h3 { font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1rem; margin: 16px 0 6px; }
        body.dark-mode .privacy-card h3 { color: #ffffff; }
        .privacy-card p, .privacy-card li { color: #4a3a60; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; }
        body.dark-mode .privacy-card p, body.dark-mode .privacy-card li { color: #d0d0d0; }
        .privacy-card ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 6px 0 10px; }
        .privacy-card hr { border: none; border-top: 2px solid #ede8f5; margin: 16px 0; }
        body.dark-mode .privacy-card hr { border-top-color: #333; }
        .privacy-card .contact-box { background: #f8f6fc; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 12px 0; }
        body.dark-mode .privacy-card .contact-box { background: #1a1a1a; }
        .privacy-card .contact-box strong { color: #8B5CF6; }
        .privacy-card .back-links { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 16px; }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .privacy-card { padding: 16px 12px; margin: 0 4px; }
            .privacy-card h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header', { user: null, showBack: true }) %>

    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="privacy-container">
            <div class="privacy-card">
                <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color:#8B5CF6;"></i> Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">SHINEX Learning Circle (SLC lmt.®)</p>

                <hr>

                <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email, date of birth, gender, country.</li>
                    <li><strong>Learning Data:</strong> Course enrollments, progress, test results.</li>
                    <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser, device.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>To create and manage your account.</li>
                    <li>To enroll you in courses.</li>
                    <li>To improve our platform.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>3. Data Security</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Your password is encrypted.</li>
                    <li>Data is stored securely.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>4. Data Sharing</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your data.</li>
                    <li>Data shared only with admins.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>5. Cookies</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>We use session cookies.</li>
                    <li>You can disable cookies.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>6. Your Rights</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Access, correct, delete your data.</li>
                    <li>Opt out of marketing.</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="contact-box">
                    <strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:balogunmustaphaaddeji@gmail.com" style="color:#8B5CF6;">balogunmustaphaaddeji@gmail.com</a>
                </div>

                <div class="back-links">
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Home</a>
                    <a href="/terms" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm"><i class="fas fa-file-contract"></i> Terms</a>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Contact</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>